      "en": "Are there yet treasures of wickedness in the house of the wicked, and a short ephah that is accursed?",
      "ko": "악인의 집에 오히려 불의한 재물이 있느냐 축소시킨 가증한 에바가 있느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "3ac33bc838b087e6f43b976cb419188c589ef331173fd9eed64a57c186f7ab98",
      "translation_text_hash": "3525399a752f4f8e5359b8d42784129901ed3f3fe2072f59f5c13565ff4b509a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
