      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MIC",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Shall I tolerate dishonest scales, and a bag of deceitful weights?",
      "ko": "내가 만일 부정한 저울을 썼거나 주머니에 거짓 저울추를 두었으면 깨끗하겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "9ca00432eeb3827a9625eeff52c6b52846a62f9779fc990c35e745fce8a45408",
      "translation_text_hash": "d6d55b50c5924ecb2a7a0e6c5731d7cf3da07e02d8c2d201e3eebae60b91615f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
